<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Duplicate user selections are prevented.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>AC-19</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin can assign users from different departments to custom groups.</p><=
/td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Users from different departments can be selected.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>AC-20</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin receives confirmation upon saving a custom user group, and the gro=
up is displayed in the group list.</p></td>
