<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Group Selection</strong>: Admin can select from predefined or cu=
stom groups.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Employee Search</strong>: Employees can be searched and added to=
 custom groups.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Tagging and Categorization</strong>: Admin can categorize users =
based on risk level, department, or team.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Custom Group Creation</strong>: Admin can create new groups by a=
dding users manually or from an existing list.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Security Handling</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Control</strong>: Only authorized admins can create and a=
ssign user groups.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Data Security</strong>: User group data is securely stored and o=
nly accessible to authorized personnel.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit</strong>: All group creation and assignment activities are=
 logged for auditing purposes.</p></li>
</ul>
